{"title":"Variance","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b> variance </b> of a data set is a measure of how \"spread out\" the data points are in general.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formula\">Formula</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Variance&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Formula\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Population\">Population</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Variance&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Population\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>For a dataset <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/102abc981afaf1f3df55b00d85af5eb8981853e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = \\{ x_1, x_2, x_3, \\dots, x_n \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" /> with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_mean\" title=\"Arithmetic mean\">mean</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9d9d7da773d694be33df9af513af204628e732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{x}$\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> the formula for variance if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Population&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Population (page does not exist)\">population</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c75e6bef818578a9483a944580f344bcf1cb09.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[V = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n (x_i - \\overline{x})^2.\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"47\" />\nAdditionally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/5/d55b754e42de6fd4cd0617490d0272568ba876a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V = \\sigma^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa35d9fc104207e09a712110ac81612c5b279a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> is the population <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Standard_deviation\" title=\"Standard deviation\">standard deviation</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sample\">Sample</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Variance&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Sample\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Because of <b>Bessel's correction</b> the variance if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sample&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sample (page does not exist)\">sample</a> is calculated according to the slightly different formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d2cd80aafdc103d50eb4f69dbf4ece5edd742a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[V = \\frac{1}{n-1}\\sum_{i=1}^n (x_i - \\overline{x})^2.\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Variance&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018113513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 265/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1437/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.064      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.064      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22554:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018113513 and revision id 172300. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}